\",\"summary\":\"Another dangerous corner kick into the six-yard box leads to a close-range scramble and shot attempt before the white goalkeeper smothers the ball.\",\"team_0\":{\"relevance\":4,\"players\":[{\"jersey_number\":null,\"position\":\"corner-kick taker\",\"tags\":[\"Pass\",\"Chance Creation\"],\"decision_score\":5,\"execution_score\":4,\"note\":\"Consistent, threatening corner delivery putting the goalkeeper under immediate pressure, like Kieran Trippier.\"},{\"jersey_number\":null,\"position\":\"striker\",\"tags\":[\"Goal\"],\"decision_score\":4,\"execution_score\":3,\"note\":\"Good instincts to attack the second ball in the scramble; try to get a cleaner first-time toe-poke or lift it over the diving keeper.\"}]},\"team_1\":{\"relevance\":0,\"players\":[]}},{\"start\":\"04:54\",\"end\":\"04:59\",\"summary\":\"Our midfielder reads white's forward pass out of the back and steps in front to make a clean interception in midfield.\",\"team_0\":{\"relevance\":4,\"players\":[{\"jersey_number\":null,\"position\":\"central midfielder\",\"tags\":[\"Interception\",\"Control\"],\"decision_score\":5,\"execution_score\":5,\"note\":\"Sharp anticipation to read the pass and step ahead of the attacker cleanly, just like N'Golo Kante.\"}]},\"team_1\":{\"relevance\":0,\"players\":[]}}]}",
